  unlockCluesOnComplete:
  - clueId: L09_LotusLeaf_Ratio
    title: Lotus Leaf - Ratio Clue
    content: The Very Small setting represents the lotus leaf wrapper used only in the final step.
    relatedIngredients:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: d9e3e41cc52bba94997680b94ac53836, type: 2}
    relatedDimension: 2
  - clueId: L09_LotusLeaf_Combination
    title: Lotus Leaf - Combination Clue
    title: Lotus Leaf - Wrapping Clue
    content: "Keep the lotus leaf out of the filling batch. Use it to wrap the prepared filling instead of grinding it into powder."
    relatedIngredients:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: d9e3e41cc52bba94997680b94ac53836, type: 2}
    relatedDimension: 3
  - clueId: L09_LotusLeaf_Order
    title: Lotus Leaf - Order Clue
    content: "Add the lotus leaf only after the filling is complete; it is the wrapper and the final step."
    relatedIngredients:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: d9e3e41cc52bba94997680b94ac53836, type: 2}
    relatedDimension: 1
  fallbackHintText: No new hint for now. Keep what worked, and change only one thing on your next try.
  progressiveHintRules:
  - ruleId: L09_Hint_GlutinousRice_Ratio
    priority: 22
    mechanic: 2
    hintText: Use the Large amount for glutinous rice. It should make up the largest share of the filling.
  - ruleId: L09_Hint_BlackSesame_Ratio
    priority: 21
    mechanic: 2
    hintText: Use the Medium amount for black sesame, one step below glutinous rice.
  - ruleId: L09_Hint_RedBean_Ratio
    priority: 20
    mechanic: 2
    hintText: Use the Small amount for red bean so its sweetness supports the filling rather than dominating it.
  - ruleId: L09_Hint_LotusLeaf_Ratio
    priority: 19
    mechanic: 2
    hintText: Set the lotus leaf to Very Small. This represents the wrapper used only in the final step, not an ingredient mixed into the filling.
  - ruleId: L09_Hint_Main_Batch_Combination
    priority: 20
    mechanic: 3
    hintText: Red bean, glutinous rice, and black sesame belong to the same filling batch. Add them in the correct order without pressing New Batch between them.
  - ruleId: L09_Hint_Lotus_Separate_Combination
    priority: 19
    mechanic: 3
    hintText: When the filling is ready, add the lotus leaf as the final separate step, then move the pestle briefly to complete the wrapping.
  - ruleId: L09_Hint_RedBean_Order
    priority: 22
    mechanic: 1
    hintText: Red bean goes first in the filling batch. Recall how it anchors the earlier dessert recipe.
  - ruleId: L09_Hint_LotusLeaf_Order
    priority: 21
    mechanic: 1
    hintText: The lotus leaf goes last, only after the filling batch is complete.
  - ruleId: L09_Hint_Middle_Order
    priority: 20
    mechanic: 1
    hintText: After red bean, add glutinous rice and then black sesame to the same filling batch. Finish with the lotus leaf.
